## Quick Start

### 1. Check Connectivity (No Auth)

```elixir
alias ZenCex.Adapters.Binance.Common

# Always verify connection first
{:ok, server_time} = Common.get_server_time()
```

### 2. Pass Credentials Explicitly

```elixir
alias ZenCex.Adapters.Binance.Spot

# PRIMARY PATTERN: Always pass auth_credentials
{:ok, balances} = Spot.get_balances(%{}, [
  auth_credentials: %{
    api_key: "your_api_key",
    api_secret: "your_api_secret",
    testnet: true  # Optional: use testnet
  }
])
```

### 3. Optional: Calling Code Reads ENV

**Your application code** (not the library) can read ENV and pass to library:

```elixir
# In YOUR application code
defmodule MyApp.Trading do
  def get_binance_balances do
    # YOUR code reads ENV
    api_key = System.get_env("BINANCE_API_KEY")
    api_secret = System.get_env("BINANCE_API_SECRET")

    # YOUR code passes to library
    ZenCex.Adapters.Binance.Spot.get_balances(%{}, [
      auth_credentials: %{
        api_key: api_key,
        api_secret: api_secret
      }
    ])
  end
end
```

