## Common Operations

### Get Market Data (No Auth)

```elixir
alias ZenCex.Adapters.Binance.MarketData

# Current price
{:ok, ticker} = MarketData.get_ticker_price(%{symbol: "BTCUSDT"})

# 24hr stats
{:ok, stats} = MarketData.get_ticker_24hr(%{symbol: "BTCUSDT"})

# Order book
{:ok, book} = MarketData.get_order_book(%{symbol: "BTCUSDT", limit: 10})
```

### Account Operations (Auth Required)

```elixir
alias ZenCex.Adapters.Binance.Spot

# Get balances
{:ok, balances} = Spot.get_balances(%{}, [
  auth_credentials: %{api_key: "key", api_secret: "secret"}
])

# Get open orders
{:ok, orders} = Spot.get_open_orders(%{}, [
  auth_credentials: %{api_key: "key", api_secret: "secret"}
])
```

### Trading (Auth Required)

```elixir
alias ZenCex.Adapters.Binance.Spot

# Market order
{:ok, order} = Spot.place_order(%{
  symbol: "BTCUSDT",
  side: "BUY",
  type: "MARKET",
  quantity: "0.001"
}, [
  auth_credentials: %{api_key: "key", api_secret: "secret"}
])

# Limit order
{:ok, order} = Spot.place_order(%{
  symbol: "BTCUSDT",
  side: "SELL",
  type: "LIMIT",
  price: "70000",
  quantity: "0.001",
  timeInForce: "GTC"
}, [
  auth_credentials: %{api_key: "key", api_secret: "secret"}
])
```

