## Parameter Patterns

### Standard Function Signatures

```elixir
# No parameters (no auth required)
{:ok, time} = Common.get_server_time()

# With parameters (no auth)
{:ok, ticker} = MarketData.get_ticker_price(%{symbol: "BTCUSDT"})

# With auth credentials
{:ok, balances} = Spot.get_balances(%{}, [
  auth_credentials: %{api_key: "key", api_secret: "secret"}
])

# With parameters and auth
{:ok, order} = Spot.place_order(%{symbol: "BTCUSDT", ...}, [
  auth_credentials: %{api_key: "key", api_secret: "secret"}
])
```

### Common Options

```elixir
[
  # Authentication (REQUIRED for authenticated endpoints)
  auth_credentials: %{
    api_key: "your_api_key",
    api_secret: "your_api_secret",
    testnet: true  # Optional
  },

  # Optional request options
  timeout: 10_000,        # Custom timeout in ms
  skip_rate_limit: true   # Bypass rate limiting
]
```

