## Quick Reference Table

| Task | Module | Function | Auth | Parameters |
|------|--------|----------|------|------------|
| **Connectivity** |
| Server time | `Common` | `get_server_time/0` | No | None |
| **Market Data** |
| Current price | `MarketData` | `get_ticker_price/1` | No | `%{symbol: "BTCUSDT"}` |
| 24hr stats | `MarketData` | `get_ticker_24hr/1` | No | `%{symbol: "BTCUSDT"}` |
| Order book | `MarketData` | `get_order_book/1` | No | `%{symbol: "BTCUSDT", limit: 20}` |
| Klines | `MarketData` | `get_klines/1` | No | `%{symbol: "BTCUSDT", interval: "1h"}` |
| **Spot Trading** |
| Get balances | `Spot` | `get_balances/2` | Yes | `%{}, [auth_credentials: creds]` |
| Place order | `Spot` | `place_order/2` | Yes | `%{symbol, side, type, ...}, [auth: creds]` |
| Cancel order | `Spot` | `cancel_order/2` | Yes | `%{symbol, orderId}, [auth: creds]` |
| Open orders | `Spot` | `get_open_orders/2` | Yes | `%{symbol}, [auth: creds]` |
| **Futures Trading** |
| Get positions | `UsdmFutures` | `get_positions/2` | Yes | `%{}, [auth_credentials: creds]` |
| Place order | `UsdmFutures` | `place_order/2` | Yes | `%{symbol, side, type, ...}, [auth: creds]` |
| Funding rate | `UsdmFutures` | `get_funding_rate/1` | No | `%{symbol: "BTCUSDT"}` |
| **WebSocket** |
| Connect | `WebSocket` | `connect/1` | No | `["btcusdt@depth20"]` |
| Subscribe | `WebSocket` | `subscribe/2` | No | `client, ["ethusdt@ticker"]` |
| Close | `WebSocket` | `close/1` | No | `client` |

**Note:** "Yes" in Auth column means you MUST pass `auth_credentials` option.

