## Common Mistakes to Avoid

### ❌ Mistake 1: Assuming ENV vars work automatically

```elixir
# ❌ WRONG - Library doesn't read ENV
export BINANCE_API_KEY="key"
Spot.get_balances()  # ERROR: No credentials!
```

### ❌ Mistake 2: Not passing credentials

```elixir
# ❌ WRONG - Missing auth_credentials
Spot.get_balances(%{})  # ERROR: Missing credentials!
```

### ❌ Mistake 3: Using wrong modules

```elixir
# ❌ WRONG - Common doesn't have ticker_price
Common.get_ticker_price(%{symbol: "BTCUSDT"})

# ✅ CORRECT - Use MarketData
MarketData.get_ticker_price(%{symbol: "BTCUSDT"})
```

### ❌ Mistake 4: Using Endpoints for API calls

```elixir
# ❌ WRONG - Endpoints is for discovery only
Endpoints.get_balances()

# ✅ CORRECT - Use product modules
Spot.get_balances(%{}, [auth_credentials: creds])
```

